{"availability":"available","full":"Dabji/Hegemony-Linear","name":"Hegemony-Linear","description":"🎲 Hegemony Linear: Simulador web hotseat de economía política para Análisis Numérico (UPB), construido con React, FastAPI y Newton-Raphson.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":11,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-10T21:45:30Z","updated":"2026-05-30T06:39:43Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hegemony-linear.vercel.app","topics":["educational-game","fastapi","game-simulation","github","github-campus-experts","gitlens","hegemony","learn","newton-raphson","numerical-methods","python","react","recharts","render","root-finding","tailwindcss","upb","vercel","vite"],"demo":"https://hegemony-linear.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:21.788Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:21.788Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:29:21.788Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:29:21.788Z","stars":11,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Simulador web hotseat de economía política para Análisis Numérico (UPB), construido con React, FastAPI y un motor Newton-Raphson para calcular el ingreso mínimo de prosperidad de la Clase Trabajadora.","Hegemony Linear is an academic hotseat web adaptation inspired by Hegemony: Lead Your Class to Victory. It was developed for the Numerical Analysis course at Universidad Pontificia Bolivariana (UPB), combining economic simulation, interactive UX and applied numerical methods.","The project demonstrates how a root-finding method can live inside a game-like experience: the Working Class, Capitalist Class, Middle Class and State make decisions about wages, taxes, goods and policies; then the backend calculates the minimum income required to reach a prosperity target."],"features":["Multi-class hotseat simulation: Working Class, Capitalist Class, Middle Class and State.","Interactive economic board: rounds, wages, taxes, goods prices